wf:ch10 a wf:ChangeRecord ; wf:baseline "원안→v2" ; wf:originalStep wf:orig08 , wf:orig09 ; wf:resultingStep wf:step11 , wf:step12 ; wf:changeType "변경" ;
    wf:change "스크립트로 명시"@ko ; wf:reason "LLM 불필요, 결과 재현성"@ko .
